{{!
    @template local_hrdashboard/status

    Status badge: dot + text, so status never relies on colour alone.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * status - Key (notstarted|inprogress|atrisk|overdue|completed|pending|soon|complete|pass|fail|incomplete).
    * label - Text.

    Example context (json):
    { "status": "atrisk", "label": "At risk" }
}}
<span class="hrd-badge hrd-badge--{{status}}">{{label}}</span>
